#: scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7190a128b875f42d1b176d3c36f665e4657b3391028e03d594edd24c3bc86b0f
#. default-sha256: 336673a7e8b3660edda310b8608416b9377ccdad5be6d91ed26284bf904e9526
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95bcc863c89a6ecf89be892487ed7f957a83d9e63e439245968133e3f3f05424
#. default-sha256: c0d7316ccf4e1b35a149ce0b47009904845f2a4790c1cb21ef60a9edbcca51a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did we get to this point?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてこんな風になっちゃったのかしら……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c1ef70461ade4b18b81a218c048a8efa13baf45e05cdcaa6382edfd9c3b8cf5
#. default-sha256: 6bf11e25aef289585f37a90f44fb6bae6262ca99bca172dc530456b0c97364ca
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ugh... ⟪k:1⟫I hate everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ああ……、⟪k:1⟫……さいあく。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4fa544fc8775c19474eeaba4b740aa6205c646143cf6d275bfcd43e40c8e0f7
#. default-sha256: 924d36e2578a2c83537c35b9faeedf7ebc4f58b26f3734d8ebea21c1350f1bd4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My spirits were getting darker and darker, like they were slowly sinking into a deep morass."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしの心は、⟪k:1⟫沼の底へ引きずり込まれるように、⟪k:2⟫暗く、⟪k:3⟫沈んでいた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d77eb34e2dd68fa1e9659ca5555ecd5b7d67a1aea41d8d6a76e9ce92679d633
#. default-sha256: 0dd2be78bd7a303ae5a9a6e7c9750bd3f183e7c956c489c58e08bc6ac7c16ba0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been at the mansion for a month, ⟪k:1⟫and every day since felt twice as long as it "
"should have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この館に来て一か月。⟪k:1⟫……それは、⟪k:2⟫一日がとても長く感じる日々だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25ee1e32d82364e11efdc062714204eef300a11a908c7423d0958b592a6ab70c
#. default-sha256: 1feadc25d7dec78661d22bc1e2a32047dd34108b0a0dd8531bdc678fee4b0350
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been optimistic, at first. ⟪k:1⟫I’d even had a little hope that me and Michel could "
"get along together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初は前向きに考えていた。⟪k:1⟫少し期待もしていた。⟪k:2⟫ミシェルとうまくやっていけるのではと"
"思っていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67532bd16b4e4822664b78e56f39c7ebd1b8a116a677f9a430b6b0a8cb658881
#. default-sha256: 70f31db914211283c2dd0df9f38c115b5280d63125be26aa61677b03afeb9b5f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it hadn’t taken long for that hope to be shattered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫そんな思いは早いうちに砕かれて――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aa796b4873ee6877c96b36bce6ffeb0daac5ab8c5c2fa044f48da67268acad7
#. default-sha256: d16917dfc8d8a890fec71103fc601cb6f06dba2080123b3b88d0ec7cf1c299ec
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the cheer locked away inside me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしの気分が浮き上がることは、⟪k:1⟫なくなっていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a86e7bb4c25bfcb9b26d6517785b5446350bbc112960c3d0c9abb5eecf4f6f01
#. default-sha256: cc64e47910bf3565a26e63361302a57b67b355882c625f140533a0cba2a14161
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We lived in the same house, but we never spoke anymore. ⟪k:1⟫On the few occasions we ⟪k:2⟫"
"did⟪k:3⟫ cross paths, he just gave me a cold glare and nothing more,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今となっては、⟪k:1⟫同じ場所に住んでいるというのに言葉も交わさず……たとえ顔を合わしたとしても、"
"⟪k:2⟫冷たい目線を投げかけられるだけ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcbb9f12006caab260d0ac77bbe70ae36efc7a97298da01549157d6dbb46847d
#. default-sha256: 8920c4323571fec15d0d5fff607ab49a27781b83e9c53e52b19c9363ed4a838a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫scorn and suspicion in his eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしを疑い、⟪k:1⟫蔑む目。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c850c92e49127eb9980546c6105d4640bfe07db4f6e957cde1b59e0cd7ea2edf
#. default-sha256: fb472a51bfcfbe8e5b0c5b4c9d66d03955172f12d2d2238c515f89bad1f9c72c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whenever he looked at me like that, it felt as though my throat was being constricted—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫like I was deep underwater and running out of air."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫圧迫感を覚える。⟪k:1⟫水の中で呼吸が出来ず、⟪k:2⟫あえぎ苦しむような……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13c889c8a00668b8c0df6917ead06a589cd5b31ec0da612979e2b8e29c44333d
#. default-sha256: a86dccb7e8b1c9035f1ec012d29156662c1916be6c61ca256789ad6e2600052a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like my very presence in the world was a crime."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしが存在することが、⟪k:1⟫許されていないような……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d2615c959bbda6e88553ff7b7710539a27b56a91c069d9a5bfbd4639ebc2e00
#. default-sha256: 5d01013f8d14402606d5ec4a85bdac55dd8498e07a035a4e2c3c5920d2af9005
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I never could have imagined just how agonizing constant rejection was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰かに否定され続けることが、⟪k:1⟫こんなにも辛いだなんて思わなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac80c7be29d293147492a5a833814cce737d091b078939459a48a95f0b0f507a
#. default-sha256: ef0bc24ed03c805b1db8ceb134b48a178c21738a837c54bb7d9f179a538fe0c9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I started despising others. ⟪k:1⟫Despising myself. ⟪k:2⟫Despising the world. ⟪k:3⟫Convinced "
"there was no one who could set me free."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……他人のことが嫌になって、⟪k:1⟫自分のことも嫌になっていく。⟪k:2⟫世界が嫌になっていく。⟪k:3⟫誰"
"もわたしを救わないんだって……そう思っていく。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 739ad5ab435b04109c7e72d9f150d6de026c95969f480ec67ca1ae235111a063
#. default-sha256: d4b545f886446e5e77334342e69db235fcbc0e9f75321aaafe05fd1b86b1621b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I considered running away from everything,⟪k:1⟫rather than live like this another day,⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫but I would have done so long ago⟪k:4⟫if that were actually an option."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫こんな日々が続くのなら、⟪k:1⟫いっそ逃げだしてしまいたい。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫でも、⟪k:4⟫それが出来るの"
"なら、⟪k:5⟫もっと早くにそうしている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f954f6d6e48780f31ba18c622e31598f60eb363a95a92aa66163cf5d84ecd0
#. default-sha256: 34706410fc832cf958f326ad645a9a234ddbc5353dee05db7af91e1bdfd6a692
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If they found out I had fled—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that I had acted outside their wishes—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫my mom and sister would pay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたしが逃げたと知られたら……、⟪k:1⟫勝手な振る舞いをしたと知られたら。⟪k:2⟫母と姉が苦しむこと"
"になるかもしれない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb3603db7ab5d671ccaa4ba0a973253b587c7842d05da03ee8978f484a5be23f
#. default-sha256: e3400c715375df7fb75cbba601a023ed6ad186c5b702fe03044b1b591435a761
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had succeeded in allowing my sister to get married and my mom to live comfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫結婚を叶えた姉……、⟪k:1⟫もう生活に苦しまないで済む母。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたしが二人の幸せを与えたのだ"
"から――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbe8472638e5876b50351993bc2d2982c70ff3c6e6a0a972e72131cf37ca39d4
#. default-sha256: 20338e98e73a27ee82304eb431e87d372795bcab9d410b7c6ae063e46cc3d6b0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had given them happiness. ⟪k:1⟫I couldn’t take that away from them again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それを消し去ってしまうなんて、⟪k:1⟫出来るわけがない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dac8ed33893d1932418c95466ba615bc464759c0ecc9f09f58f7e7771e6d7394
#. default-sha256: a2fcc7588313621d67bb7f3f3bed526cb39f04aac4885d449f4b26db7b53601c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not after what I had to go through to do it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だってせっかく、⟪k:1⟫わたしが……あんな思いをしてまで……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a1964c1cbc276107b2d6e2df4092d4f585e1512792070afeebcebbb9b6b4b0e
#. default-sha256: 2b682c8e20fab89dbfe1dea99e9e3babc4305b62608a365e7f5de42397723371
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, no, cut that out. ⟪k:1⟫Getting way too depressing, Giselle.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（ああ、⟪k:1⟫いけない……。⟪k:2⟫もう、⟪k:3⟫どんどん考えが暗くなっちゃう）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba5e38432372681bf6b0f4cb061be04b432c456cac49354d21777d200eb197ee
#. default-sha256: 06a8ad2b81cf7fd6f3e3767aaed78fdbdf4bcef3e75c1053b04d60586f3eda04
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Pull yourself together! That’s not who you are!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（しっかりしてよね、⟪k:1⟫ジゼル！　⟪k:2⟫わたし、⟪k:3⟫こんな人間じゃなかったわ！）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14f5c07f87b37372750598822713893bac84caf7e120bd0101660b79907e4b64
#. default-sha256: b2a9751ff7f0262e6924d261e0d47993f6b2fba684d9cf1f74e0e7bc5a2180ce
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Be positive...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（しっかり……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3f30ff888d9a78b8d745462e65eddd95740de631dd32d40957438f1cf309ad2
#. default-sha256: ffcf52935da5c086527518edb205f32edd2c5d342c58726a337940c23e5a4eb6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The negativity didn’t only come from my interactions with Michel, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あの人と関わっているから――、⟪k:1⟫それだけが理由じゃない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫なんだか、⟪k:4⟫この館に"
"は……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 308160be6a1ee3735020f2ad5aaab7691fd480a7a393e599d9d6fd3bf89c5374
#. default-sha256: cfe0b26974462b1381ff756d25beae37850017f212c5576085d4d8d59853cca9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, there seemed to be some kind of terrible presence within the mansion that twisted "
"people’s hearts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫人の気持ちを歪めていくような禍々しさが、⟪k:1⟫こびり付いているように感じられた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e39d53d13b6792315acfe18779b29c6b9b481df4b01aee71ae3e5c63d561b9f
#. default-sha256: 647d39b78b751c4d9706585df88de0cddbd2351832d970c1ea179404da61f999
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion was, in fact, a bit of a local legend, which I had been informed about before "
"being sent here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魔女の住む呪われた館……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ミシェルは自分が魔女だなんて言ったけれど。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df06ed2c626a8d506517338edcfa1c258a5684772269c131415125eb6218e37d
#. default-sha256: 50313501ed57140022a3125f7f2f3c99e854e22d67f7f6b5e3954a5870b56ce4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People claimed it was cursed, and that an evil witch had lived in it for many, many years."
msgstr ""
